Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "FoggyRainyIntersection" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk2 ;
    :occursInScene :scene1 ;
    :description "Severely reduced visibility due to fog and rain at an intersection" .

:weather1 a :FoggyCondition, :RainyCondition .

:risk1 a :RoadConditionRisk ;
    :description "Slippery road surface due to rain affecting braking distance" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .

:risk2 a :OcclusionRisk ;
    :description "Limited visibility of road ahead and potential hazards due to heavy fog" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.90"^^xsd:float .

Identified Risks for each risk class
Risk 1:
Description: Slippery road surface due to rain affecting braking distance
Severity Score: 0.75

Risk 2:
Description: Limited visibility of road ahead and potential hazards due to heavy fog
Severity Score: 0.90